QuestGuidance.Register("en",253,{
[8065]="7002E4FB\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Egmund\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[8066]="700561E3\n1\tRefill lanterns (total: 6)\tLanterns can be found in the Rohan Eastfold Homesteads. You should fill the lanterns.\n",
[8067]="7001542D\n1\tLight lamps along the winding path (total: 9)\tThe lamps can be found on the long winding descent into the pit at the centre of the Silvertine Lodes. You should descend the path and light the lamps as you go.\n2\tTalk to Thalfar\tThalfar can be found at the small mining camp near Menem-berej in the Silvertine Lodes. You should return to Thalfar and tell him that the lamps are lit once more.\n",
[8068]="7001601C\n1\tSpeak with Slagvi at the Dolven-view\tSlagvi is at the Dolven-view camp in the Great Delving in Moria. You should speak with Slagvi of the mirror you adjusted.\n",
[8069]="7003312F\n1\tLight warning flames in Hurmulkezer (total: 4)\tHurmulkezer is located just south of Durin's Court, in the south-eastern Flaming Deeps. You should light pyres in Hurmulkezer.\n2\tCompleted\tThe pyres of Hurmulkezer are lit, providing a warning to the dwarves that the enemies currently claim this stronghold, and it would be deadly to enter unawares.\n",
[8070]="70057814\n1\tYou can find sapphire fireflies in Dol Ringwest, emerald in the Midgewater Marshes, ruby in Rushock Bog, and amethyst in the Grimwater from gloaming till dawn. You should collect fireflies for the wedding planner in Minas Tirith.\t\n2\tTalk to Merilien\tThe wedding planner Merilien is located in Minas Tirith. You should return to Merilien in Minas Tirith.\n",
[8071]="70052946\n1\tDefeat Linduin fire-flies (total: 12)\tLinduin fire-flies can be found in Laerlad. You should defeat Linduin fire-flies.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Linduin fire-flies in Laerlad.\n",
[8072]="70026180\n1\tLight the lamps (total: 12)\tBurned-out lamps can be found on the paths around the Northcotton Farm. Milo Longfurrow has asked you to help him illuminate the area by lighting the lamps around the Farmer's Market at the Northcotton Farm.\n2\tTalk to Milo Longfurrow\tMilo Longfurrow is in Northcotton Farm. Milo Longfurrow will be pleased to hear the lamps will burn the night through.\n",
[8073]="7002248A\n1\tDefeat Limrafn in Haudh Valandil (total: 30)\tLimrafn stalk Haudh Valandil, the tomb on the island beyond the bridge of Ariant, in Annúminas. You should defeat the limrafn that stalk the depths of Haudh Valandil.\n",
[8074]="7002C00F\n1\tTalk to Céola when you are ready to defend Etheburg\tCéola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. Céola has asked you to help the Rohirrim border-guard defend against the Khundolar's retaliation. NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.\n2\tTalk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands\tCéola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. You should speak with Céola regarding the victory at Etheburg.\n",
[8075]="7002CFBE\n1\tTalk to Céola when you are ready to defend Etheburg\tCéola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. Céola has asked you to help the Rohirrim border-guard defend against the Khundolar's retaliation. NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo, but can be run with a Duo as well.\n2\tTalk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands\tCéola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. You should speak with Céola regarding the victory at Etheburg.\n",
[8076]="7006BD7A\n1\tDefeat Ordâkhai soldiers (total: 10)\tOrdâkhai soldiers can be found throughout TBD Khud Zagin. TBD has asked you to defeat several wandering patrols of Ordâkhai soldiers through TBD various parts of Khud Zagin.\n2\tReturn to TBD Rebel Sharpshooter\tTBD Rebel Sharpshooter can be found in Ghalburu. Return to TBD Rebel Sharpshooter,\n",
[8077]="700683C9\n1\tCollect buffalo haunches ([see journal]/14)\tMake your way into the plains, desert, or savannah to find water buffalo. Slaughter the beasts; carve haunches off their bones and deliver the meat to Khânai at the expedition camp. You will find them north, east, and west from the hunter's encampment.\n2\tTalk to Khânai\tMake your way into the plains, desert, or savannah to find water buffalo. Slaughter the beasts; carve haunches off their bones and deliver the meat to Khânai at the expedition camp.\n",
[8078]="7006BF3E\n1\tDefeat Curthádi at Róthirin (total: 10)\tBring peace by force to the restless Curthádi spirits at Róthirin.\n2\tReport back to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin\tReport back to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin that you've brought peace to many Curthádi at Róthirin.\n",
[8079]="7003A4DC\n1\tCollect water-lilies (total: 4)\tThe pond that contains the water-lilies is just to the west of the Mead Hall. Selethryth asked you to gather water-lilies to feed her goat.\n2\tTalk to Selethryth\tSelethryth is north-west of the Mead Hall of Fenmarch. You have gathered a number of water-lilies and should bring them back to Selethryth so that she may feed her hungry goat.\n",
[8080]="70002E56\n1\tFind the perfect lily\tA perfect lily grows somewhere along the Bruinen east of Arrod's post. Arrod has asked you to bring him a perfect lily of exquisite beauty. No other kind will do.\n2\tTalk to Arrod\030Collect Rare Flower\tArrod is watching the road through the Bruinen Gorges from his vantage point near a set of hilltop ruins, west of the Bruinen. Arrod will be delighted to see that you have found a lily of exquisite beauty.\n",
[8081]="70052F03\n1\tCollect pond lilies (total: 12)\tPond lilies can be found in ponds throughout the Beorning-lands. You should collect pond lilies for Haldis.\n2\tDecorate Grimbeorn's hall (total: 12)\tHaldis wishes for you to decorate the inside of Grimbeorn's lodge. You should decorate the inside of the lodge with the lilies you collected.\n3\tTalk to Haldis\tHaldis can be found at the Beorninghús. You should inform Haldis that the decorations are complete.\n",
[8082]="700077F7\n1\tTalk to Lily Underhill at her house\tLily Underhill can be found outside her home east of Gammy Boggs' home, at the foot of the hill, north of the road. Gammy Boggs believes that with the proper coaxing, Lily will tell all that she knows about Falco's plight.\n2\tCollect red lilies (total: 6)\tRed lilies can be found in the forested area south of the Yellow Tree, well to the south of Lily Underhill's house. Lily Underhill said she could not say specifically what Falco Greenhand's trouble was, but she could show you, if you looked at the right things. As a hint, she sent you to gather red lilies.\n3\tBring the red lilies to Lily Underhill at her farm.\tLily Underhill can be found outside her home, east of Gammy Boggs' farm. Lily Underhill said she could not say specifically what Falco Greenhand's trouble was, but she could show you, if you looked at the right things. As a hint, she sent you to gather red lilies. Upon finding the lilies, you also noticed the large encampment of brigands at Ost Baranor.\n4\tTalk to Gammy Boggs at her farm.\tGammy Boggs is at her farm, west of Lily Underhill's house. Lily told you -- without telling you -- that the Big Folk camped at the ruins in the south Chetwood are the reason that Falco Greenhand's farm is suffering. You should tell Gammy Boggs what you know.\n",
[8083]="7006617F\n1\tCollect lilies in the marsh (total: 8)\tBruidis has asked you to help her collect lilies from the marsh north of Tadrent.\n2\tTalk to Bruidis in Tadrent\tYou have collected plenty of lilies. You should bring them to Bruidis in Tadrent.\n",
[8084]="7006AED2\n1\tDestroy corrupted relics (total: 5)\tSeek out and destroy relics that are said to be corrupting the ground near Jâx Ugikh.\n2\tTalk to Azrât in Kên Taghlim\tReturn to Kên Taghlim and inform Azrât that the corrupted relics have been destroyed.\n",
[8085]="70028254\n1\tCollect chain-links (total: 5)\tChain-links may be found on wights outside Plas-maru, east of Ilar's camp. Ilar has asked you to recover chain-links from fallen wights.\n2\tTalk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales\tIlar is at his camp, west of Plas-maru. You should bring the chain-links that you recovered to Ilar.\n",
[8086]="7000887B\n1\tReturn to Lieutenant Solvi at Tol Ascarnen\030Collect draughts of Hoarhallow-ale (total: 10)\tYou may be able to find some in Hoarhallow itself, but it will likely be costly. You may even find the draughts stored at Grothum and Dâr-gazag. Lieutenant Solvi asked you to find and recover draughts of Hoarhallow-ale.\n",
[8087]="70043008\n1\tTalk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui\030Talk to Merenir, Captain of the Guard, in the centre of Imloth Melui\030Talk to Hathalon, Master-at-arms, in the north of Imloth Melui\tHathalon trains new recruits in the northern part of Imloth Melui. Merenir oversees the flow of refugees by the fountain in the middle of town. Master Healer Brunil treats the injured within the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui. Lady Vanyalos has asked you to talk to the people she trusts in Imloth Melui and determine their moods.\n2\tTalk to Lady Vanyalos in her hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui\tLady Vanyalos is in her hall on the north-eastern rise in Imloth Melui. You should return to Lady Vanyalos and report what you have heard from her three trusted advisors.\n",
[8088]="70069449\n1\tCraft a crate of bows for the Umbar Woodworker's Guild\tThe recipe needed to complete this quest is available for purchase. Purchase the quest recipe from the guild leader. Package a crate of bows for Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tDeliver a crate of bows to the Umbar Woodworker's Guild Leader\tProvide the crate of bows to the Umbar Woodworker's Guild Leader.\n",
[8089]="7006B105\n1\tCraft a crate of bows for the Umbar Woodworker's Guild\tThe recipe needed to complete this quest is available for purchase. Purchase the quest recipe from the guild leader. Package a crate of bows for Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tDeliver a crate of bows to the Umbar Woodworker's Guild Leader\tProvide the crate of bows to the Umbar Woodworker's Guild Leader.\n",
[8090]="70017583\n1\tChallenge Brestir to a duel at the Bridge of Khazad-dûm\tThe Bridge of Khazad-dûm, where Brestir can be found, is north of the Foundations of Stone and east of the Second Hall. Dithrik has invited you to challenge his friend Brestir to a duel to see if you are prepared for the challenges ahead.\n2\tReturn to Dithrik at the Foundations of Stone\t\n",
[8091]="70066BBA\n1\tSearch the cave at Lithengris\tYou should search the cave at Lithengris for the source of the corpse's injuries.\n2\tExamine the Corsair corpse\tYou have found another Corsair corpse in the cave at Lithengris that bears similar injuries to the other's. You should examine this second corpse.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a giant crab in the caves of Lithengris.\n",
[8092]="7002EF1E\n1\tCollect Léofrun's doll\tBote, Léofrun's doll, is somewhere within the ruins of Thornhope. Léofrun has asked you to find her doll Bote.\n2\tBring the doll to Léofrun outside Thornhope\tLéofrun is encamped outside the walls of Thornhope. You should return the frightened little girl's doll to its owner.\n",
[8093]="7000AF32\n1\tEscort Tortmund Cliffside to the Grimwood Lumber camp\tTortmund Cliffside is at the tower on the eastern border of Hoarhallow, just over the bridge. Sergeant-at-Arms Aeglas has asked you to see the safe arrival of the hobbits from Hoarhallow. The hobbits will be assisting the Free Peoples in acquiring enough materials to create bulwarks throughout the Ettenmoors.\n",
[8094]="7001547E\n1\tDefeat Zâhof\tZâhof can be found at Fehem-dûm, east from Jazârgund. Zâhof is the leader of the White Hand Uruks in Moria. If he falls, Saruman's plans for the deeps fall with him.\n2\tPlant the Mordor-banner on Zâhof's throne\030Collect Banner of Mordor\tZâhofs throne is in Fehem-dûm, east from Jazârgund. Ión wishes to stir up strife between the Orcs of Moria and Mordor. He gave you a banner to plant upon the throne of the fallen White Hand Uruk.\n3\tTalk to Ión at Jazârgund\tIón is at Jazârgund, west from Fehem-dûm. Ión will be pleased to hear Zâhof is dead and the Mordor-banner has been planted on his throne.\n",
[8095]="7006AB5E\n1\tLeave food offerings near Sektakhâb (total: 2)\tAmarêkh, one of the Temámir guards stationed in Mekab-kuphâr, has asked you to leave offerings of food for the \"little spirits\" throughout Khabârkhad. The first location is west of Mekab-kuphâr, near Sektakhâb, where the Dead walk.\n2\tLeave food offerings near Nishabêt (total: 2)\tThe second location is north of Mekab-kuphâr, near Nishabêt, home of monstrous spiders.\n3\tLeave food offerings near Lôkhalel (total: 2)\tThe third location is north-west of Mekab-kuphâr, near Lôkhalel, where tomb robbers keep their council.\n4\tReturn to the Temámir Guard Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr\tReturn to the Temámir Guard Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr in southern Khabârkhad.\n",
[8096]="70020DAA\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair\tThere are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens. You should bring the object you found to the Rangers of the Grey Company. Perhaps they will be able to unravel the mystery.\n",
})
